                            	   876: StoryPaletteTransferRecord:
                            	   877:     ; Full 32-byte NES palette record (BG 0-3 + spr 0-3).
                            	   878:     ; Sprite pals 0,2 both map to CRAM pal 2; 1,3 both map to CRAM pal 3.
