                            	  6245: _L_z05_UpdateDoors_LoopTransferRec:
                            	  6246:     ; Copy [06] to [04] for the call to write tiles below.
                            	  6247:     ; We need to remember how many tiles need to be copied
                            	  6248:     ; in each transfer record.
