                            	  3984: _L_z07_WieldFlute_Found:
                            	  3985:     ; Found.
                            	  3986:     ;
                            	  3987:     ; If it was the first room in the list, handle it specially.
                            	  3988:     ; This room is the only one in Q1 with a flute secret. It's also
                            	  3989:     ; the only one in the list without a flute secret in Q2.
                            	  3990:     ;
                            	  3991:     ; In Q2, go summon the whirlwind. In Q1, continue to reveal
                            	  3992:     ; the secret.
                            	  3993:     ;
